  {
    "id": 3,
    "name": "内里",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-CN/02_img_AR_label_03_zh_CN.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR03_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_03.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_header_03_txt_zh_CN.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_txt_title_03_zh_CN.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_icon_early_zh_CN.png",
      "text": "内里是天皇日常生活、处理政事的场所。在后期的宫殿中，被设立在远离大极殿院和朝堂院的北侧，但在前期难波宫中，朝堂院的广阔空间一直延伸到内里的正门——内里南门的南侧。内里南门宽7柱间（约32.7米），是古代宫殿中最大的门。据推测采用的是掘立柱式结构和板葺式屋顶这一日本传统宫殿建筑风格。",
      "photo_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_photo_03.png",
      "photo_text_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_txt_photo_03_zh_CN.png",
      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR03_detail_cn.mp3"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "name": "八角殿",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-CN/02_img_AR_label_04_zh_CN.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR04_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_04.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_header_04_txt_zh_CN.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_txt_title_04_zh_CN.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_icon_early_zh_CN.png",
      "text": "八角殿位于内里南门的东西两侧，发掘调查结果表明，内部柱子采用柱孔一侧斜向挖宽的特殊方式竖立，由此推测其外观为多层建筑，高近15米。关于其用途众说纷纭，但有人认为八边形结构的楼阁建筑是为了使宫殿的中心部分更加庄严，体现出了浓烈的中国大陆宫殿建筑理念。",
      "photo_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_photo_04.png",
      "photo_text_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_txt_photo_04_zh_CN.png",
      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR04_detail_cn.mp3"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "name": "大极殿院",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-CN/02_img_AR_label_05_zh_CN.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR05_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_05.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_header_00-05_txt_zh_CN.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_txt_title_05_zh_CN.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_img_icon_late_zh_CN.png",
      "text": "大极殿院在由庄严的复廊环绕的空间内，建造了后期难波宫最重要的建筑——大极殿和大极殿后殿。大极殿是一座正面约42米、深约21米，建于石造基座上，屋顶为瓦葺式，柱子采用被涂成红色的建筑，可以推测其具有中国风外观。屋檐采用图案简单的重环纹瓦当和板瓦。新年朝贺（臣民新年参拜天皇）以及外国使节觐见等国家仪式举行之际，天皇会端坐在大极殿中央的“高御座”上。",
      "photo_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_photo_05.png",
      "photo_text_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-CN/03_txt_photo_05_zh_CN.png",
      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR05_06_detail_cn.mp3"
    }
  },
